  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1613.01 Purpose and Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1613.01 Purpose and Applicability.\n\n(a) The rules contained in this chapter are intended to apply to a variety of conditions and circumstances.\n\n(b) Any person may request a waiver from any provision established by Env-Wq 1600 in accordance with this part.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
